      "  Attempts \(.activity.current_active_backlog.attempts)  work items \(.activity.current_active_backlog.work_items)  age p50 \(.activity.current_active_backlog.age_ms.p50 | duration)  p95 \(.activity.current_active_backlog.age_ms.p95 | duration)  max \(.activity.current_active_backlog.age_ms.max | duration)",
